# Derived data. gen_corpus.py is deterministic (seed 20260903), so the GENERATOR
# plus the seed is the reproducible artifact -- regenerate with:
#     python3 gen_corpus.py 200000
# The 200k corpus is ~300 MB, well past GitHub's 100 MB limit, and committing
# derived data that can be reproduced byte-for-byte adds no evidentiary value.
corpus.jsonl
corpus.jsonl.gz
